                       └ WHEN · Finding mutually incompatible claims or instructions.

2 · mem fit ┬ Judge whether a defined set of Memories or other propositions is jointly compatible under ordinary interpretation, returning YES, MAY, or NO.
            └ WHEN · Checking whether a defined set of Memories, Rules, Goals, Examples, or other propositions can jointly hold.

3 · mem audit ┬ Run Duplicate, Ambiguity, and Conflict checks plus optional Rule Conformance, then review the combined saved result.
              └ WHEN · Performing a combined quality review before revising a Context.
